    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Recently, the Task Force has been searching for clues on the Hetero-Hive Mother on the surface.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Do you remember Vonnegut mentioning the Hive Mother in the sewers was just a \"test subject\"?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Yeah.",
            18
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Right. After that, Asimov and I confirmed one thing as we exchanged data, which is that among the Hetero-Hive Mothers exists an advanced being, hidden somewhere on earth, waiting to hatch.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "The several Hive Mothers the Task Force found so far are not as developed as the one underneath City 075. Some of them haven't even developed a functional heart.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "This discovery also confirmed the idea that the same Hetero-Creature would multiply into multiple beings.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Based on the Polyphage and the Hetero-Hive Mother in the sewers, Ascendants can have a pivotal role in helping the Hetero-Creatures grow.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "That undiscovered, advanced subject has Vonnegut aiding its growth, so its level of completion must be second to none.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Which makes locating it a time-sensitive task. There are three reasons I'm looking for you now.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "First...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "The specialized frame.",
            26
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Indeed. We defeated the Hetero-Hive Mother with my Glory frame, which means Lucia, with her specialized frame, is also capable of defeating the same enemy type.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Second...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "The Punishing Virus overloading.",
            29
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "That's right. Since the Hive Mother will overload Inver-Devices with the Punishing Virus, we require a commandant on the scene to stabilize the Constructs to prevent infection.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "And the one who has multiple experiences fighting Ascendants and powerful Hetero-Creatures, as well as having connected to Corrupted by Huaxu without being infected is the perfect candidate.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "So you know about what happened in City 075?",
            32
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Yes, I do. I took advantage of my father's position to gather some information.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Chrome answers directly. You can tell that he has no intention to use that information against you by how sincere his gaze is."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Third...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gray Raven on the frontline is the best encouragement for the army.",
            36
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "Exactly. The frontline is dangerous, sure, but removing threats on the fiercest battlefield will score Gray Raven another major achievement, further stoking the flame of hope. This also matches what the Parliament wants for your team.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "...",
            38
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "There's a fourth reason, isn't there?",
            39
        ]
