        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "I knew I can't hide anything from you...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Is your frame really alright?",
            42
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "It is. And thanks to that experience, we managed to record the abnormal data and confirm our hypothesis on the evolution of the Hive Mother.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "But the Science Council can't rule out that the overload will do further damage to the Glory frame, which is why Strike Hawk has to stay on Babylonia to help with the research on the Hetero-Hive Mother instead of fighting on the field.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "What about Camu?",
            46
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "A Camu who works alone away from Strike Hawk is deemed too dangerous by others.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "And given his uniqueness, he will be staying with us and assisting the Science Council on their research for now.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "I see.",
            49
