    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "In conclusion, I feel like Gray Raven is our best option when it comes to missions that concern the advanced subject.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Chrome stresses his voice when he says, \"Gray Raven is our best option.\""
