    {
        "Id": 65,
        "ActionId": 65,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "First, allow me to explain the current situation on behalf of Mr. Asimov once again.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 66,
        "ActionId": 66,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "The Science Council's current research requires a large amount of Punishing Virus samples. With sufficient samples, the research progress can advance by 40%.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 67,
        "ActionId": 67,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "But not any samples. The higher the strength of the sample, the more accurate the data it provides.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "Among Corrupted, Hetero-Creatures, and Ascendants, Hetero-Creatures are best-suited to study, given that it evolves from the Punishing Virus itself.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "Among the Hetero-Creatures, highly-developed entities like the Polyphage, Siren, and the Hetero-Hive Mother are the most ideal samples.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "Chrome has already told you about the advanced Hetero-Hive Mother.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "Currently, we have discovered and destroyed several Hive Mothers that developed naturally, but their completion rate cannot compare to the one found in the sewers.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 72,
        "ActionId": 72,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "So we hypothesize that the Hetero-Hive Mother aided by Vonnegut is most likely the purest being made with the Punishing Virus.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 73,
        "ActionId": 73,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Researcher",
            "Now, let's exchange information to locate the advanced subject out there.",
            1
        ]
