        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Chrome",
            "There were two known factors. Data of Luna at her prime, recorded by Ouroboros, and the time difference between Strike Hawk's first retreat from the sewers and our second return there when we ran into Vonnegut.",
            1
